# Chalk Outline: "one or more creature cards leave your graveyard" is a single trigger for a batch (CR 603.2c, 603.10a). Turn 1: Black
# Lotus (RRR) and Mox Emerald pay it, Mox Ruby pays Faithless Looting, which discards Hero of Bladehold and Llanowar Elves - six
# mana value in the graveyard with the Lotus (0) and the Looting (1). Turn 3: Grizzly Bears. Turn 5: Bite Down on Crime collects
# evidence 6 - Hero, Elves and Looting leave the graveyard together, two creature cards and one other - and the Chalk Outline makes
# exactly one Detective and one Clue, not two of each; Bite Down's own damage is dealt to Bot2's Wall of Stone as usual.

